abel": "Using an Artificial Financial Market for Studying a Cryptocurrency Market (Cocco, Concas, Marchesi 2015)", "file_type": "paper", "source_file": "documenti/esempio-progetto-LAM.pdf", "source_location": "p45", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "documenti_esempio_progetto_lam_crisi_2008", "label": "Crisi finanziaria 2008 / bolla immobiliare USA", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "documenti/esempio-progetto-LAM.pdf", "source_location": "p12-13", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "documenti_esempio_progetto_lam_bolla_speculativa", "label": "Bolla speculativa", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "documenti/esempio-progetto-LAM.pdf", "source_location": "p12-13", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Metaphor of soap bubble: prices inflate via euphoria and FOMO detached from fundamentals, then burst; smart traders cannot stop dumb traders inflating it."}, {"id": "documenti_esempio_progetto_lam_the_big_short", "label": "The Big Short (film)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "documenti/esempio-progetto-LAM.pdf", "source_location": "p13", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "documenti_esempio_progetto_lam_alan_greenspan", "label": "Alan Greenspan (irrational exuberance, 1996)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "documenti/esempio-progetto-LAM.pdf", "source_location": "p12", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "documenti_esempio_progetto_lam_btc_market_simulator", "label": "Simulatore agent-based del mercato BTC", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "documenti/esempio-progetto-LAM.pdf", "source_location": "p6", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Built to study how rational and irrational agents interact; existing literature models do not clearly distinguish operator types, so three classes were introduced."}, {"id": "documenti_esempio_progetto_lam_ipotesi_smart_outperform", "label": "Ipotesi: smart trader performano meglio", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "documenti/esempio-progetto-LAM.pdf", "source_location": "p5", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "documenti_esempio_progetto_lam_smart_traders", "label": "Smart traders (agenti razionali)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "documenti/esempio-progetto-LAM.pdf", "source_location": "p6-9, p23", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Simplified as aggressive contrarians (buy when price_ratio<0.9 or crash, sell when >1.1 or rally) to capture the statistical edge of real funds/HFT without replicating their complexity."}, {"id": "documenti_esempio_progetto_lam_dumb_traders", "label": "Dumb traders (agenti irrazionali)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "documenti/esempio-progetto-LAM.pdf", "source_location": "p7, p9, p25", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Majority; driven by FOMO and panic, buy rallies, sell crashes, chase micro-trends with large order fractions (15-45%)."}, {"id": "documenti_esempio_progetto_lam_normal_traders", "label": "Normal traders", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "documenti/esempio-progetto-LAM.pdf", "source_location": "p7, p10, p27", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Intermediate background noise: buy prob 0.5 + sentiment adjustment + price adjustment, clamped to [0.2,0.8]; volumes 2-8%."}, {"id": "documenti_esempio_progetto_lam_contrarian_strategy", "label": "Strategia contrarian (compra basso, vendi alto)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "documenti/esempio-progetto-LAM.pdf", "source_location": "p8", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "documenti_esempio_progetto_lam_price_ratio", "label": "price_ratio (prezzo / prezzo di riferimento)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "documenti/esempio-progetto-LAM.pdf", "source_location": "p23", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "documenti_esempio_progetto_lam_prezzo_di_riferimento", "label": "Prezzo di riferimento (Cref)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "documenti/esempio-progetto-LAM.pdf", "source_location": "p10, p17", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "documenti_esempio_progetto_lam_rally_crash_detection", "label": "is_rally / is_crash / recent_trend", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "documenti/esempio-progetto-LAM.pdf", "source_location": "p23-25", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "documenti_esempio_progetto_lam_order_book_aggregato", "label": "Order book aggregato (matrice n x 3)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "documenti/esempio-progetto-LAM.pdf", "source_location": "p14, p28", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "documenti_esempio_progetto_lam_matching_pro_quota", "label": "Matching aggregato pro-quota", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "documenti/esempio-progetto-LAM.pdf", "source_location": "p15, p28-29", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Sums all demand and supply; traded = min(demand_btc, supply_btc); fills proportional per agent — simple structure where aggregate liquidity sets depth."}, {"id": "documenti_esempio_progetto_lam_ordini_residui_persistenti", "label": "Ordini residui persistenti", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "documenti/esempio-progetto-LAM.pdf", "source_location": "p15", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "documenti_esempio_progetto_lam_bid_ask_spread", "label": "Bid/ask spread", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "documenti/esempio-progetto-LAM.pdf", "source_location": "p15, p29", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "documenti_esempio_progetto_lam_fee_rate", "label": "Fee rate (commissioni)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "documenti/esempio-progetto-LAM.pdf", "source_location": "p17, p29", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "documenti_esempio_progetto_lam_market_impact", "label": "Market impact (impact_k)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "documenti/esempio-progetto-LAM.pdf", "source_location": "p17, p29", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "new_price = price*(1 + impact_k*net_pressure/total volume); demand/supply imbalance drives direction, modelling slippage."}, {"id": "documenti_esempio_progetto_lam_volatilita", "label": "Volatilità (shock casuale)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "documenti/esempio-progetto-LAM.pdf", "source_location": "p14, p17", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Price = order-flow direction + random shock for realism; parameter sets daily random amplitude."}, {"id": "documenti_esempio_progetto_lam_mining", "label": "Mining e offerta", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "documenti/esempio-progetto-LAM.pdf", "source_location": "p15-16", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Each day a random active miner receives a fixed BTC amount added to sellable quantity, simulating gradual new supply."}, {"id": "documenti_esempio_progetto_lam_sentiment", "label": "Sentiment aggregato di mercato", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "documenti/esempio-progetto-LAM.pdf", "source_location": "p30-32", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "0.5*price deviation from Cref